000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   S R E Q P R N T                                  *
001200*                                                    *
001300*   THIS SUB PROGRAM DOES THE ACTUAL PRINTING        *
001400*   OF THE REQUISITION. NEW FORMAT 2 PAGES.          *
001500*                                                    *
      *                                                    *
      ******************************************************
      *C                                                   *
      *C  10/30/96   CA YODER   REQ #94-059                *
      *C  RE-FORMATTED REQ. PRINT SO THAT NO SPECIAL       *
      *C  PRINT CHARACTERS ARE USED.  THIS WAY, IT WILL    *
      *C  BE ABLE TO BE PRINTED ON A LASER PRINTER.        *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  10/30/96   CA YODER   REQ #96-034                *
      *C  ADDED LAST SUPPLIER'S FAX NUMBER TO REQ.         *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  11/22/96   CA YODER   REQ #96-027                *
      *C  ADDED CURRENCY CODE TO REQ. IF PLANT WANTS IT    *
      *C  DISPLAYED (KEY=PREQ IN MPLTINFO).                *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  02/19/97   CA YODER                              *
      *C  MADE CHANGES TO REQ PER J. THOMAS REQUEST.  THE  *
      *C  "LAST PO DATA" SECTION WAS REMOVED IN ORDER TO   *
      *C  PUT DATA FOR UP TO 3 QUOTES.                     *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  17JUL1997  DAVE PLUM                             *
      *C  REVISED TO PROVIDE FOR THE POSSIBILITY THAT      *
      *C  FIELD VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT (VEN-DSCT, VEN-DSCT1, *
      *C  VEN-DSCT2) MAY CONTAIN NON-NUMERIC DATA.         *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  25NOV1997  WL MCINTYRE                           *
      *C  REVISED TO PRINT OUT REQ PRICE OUT TO 4          *
      *C  DECIMAL PLACES.                                  *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  17JUL1998  CA YODER                              *
      *C  CORRECTED PROBLEM DISCOVERED WITH DES MOINES     *
      *C  TESTING.  IF ONLY ONE VENDOR IN VENDOR FILE,     *
      *C  CAUSED LOOPING PROBLEM.                          *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  03DEC1998  JE COFFMAN                            *
      *C  ADDED CODE FOR TYLER TO FORCE THEIR GENERIC      *
      *C  USER 'PURCH' TO PRINT ON LASER PRINTER.          *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  07JUN1999  CA YODER                              *
      *C  ADDED LAST VENDOR FAX NUMBER TO PRINTOUT AT      *
      *C  VALLEYFIELD'S REQUEST.                           *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  08JUL1999  CA YODER                              *
      *C  ADDED VENDOR CONTACT NAME TO PRINTOUT AT         *
      *C  VALLEYFIELD'S REQUEST.                           *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  30JAN2002  BE GEISER                             *
      *C  CHANGED TAX MESSAGE LOGIC TO USE REQ TAX CODE    *
      *C  VALUE FIRST (IF ANY) THEN ITEM TAX CODE SECOND.  *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  11APR2002  CA YODER    (LAWTON REQUEST)          *
      *C  ADDED CONSIGNMENT FLAG TO REQ PRINTOUT.          *
      *C                                                   *
      *C  08/04/2004 GEISER      (GADSDEN REQUEST)         *
      *C  ADDED REQ TYPE LITERAL (SERVICE/REPAIR/MATERIAL).*
      *C                                                   *
001600******************************************************
