149000**************************************************
149100*                                                *
149200*   THIS PROCEDURE DOES THE ACTUAL PRINTING OF   *
149300*   THE REQUISITION TO THE BUYER CHAR. PRINTER   *
149400*                                                *
149500**************************************************
149600
149700 6-WRITE-REQ.
           IF REQ-NUMBER-1 = "M"
      **************************************************
      *   ADDED LOGIC TO PRE-READ MREQ HERE SO THAT    *
      *   THE NEW LOGIC FOR MCPRTP/MCPRTL LASER PRINTS *
      *   CAN SET THE MCPRT FILE PER TYLER'S REQUEST   *
      *   TO JIM COFFMAN                               *
      **************************************************
               MOVE REQ-NUMBER          TO REQ-ARG
               MOVE REQ-ARG             TO REQNO OF MREQ-REC-I
               READ MREQ-I INTO BUF-MREQ
               IF USERNAME = "PURCH"
                   MOVE SAVE-REQ-PRT-NO-2X TO REQ-SPOOL-PRT-X
               ELSE
               IF REQ-APPROVALS-LEFT = "  "
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               IF REQ-APPROVALS-LEFT-9 < 1
                   AND REQ-RELEASE-STAT = "X "
                       MOVE SAVE-REQ-PRT-NO TO REQ-SPOOL-PRT-X
               ELSE
               MOVE "P "                TO  REQ-SPOOL-PRT-X
           ELSE
           IF SAVE-REQ-PRT-NO-2X = "  " OR "00"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           MOVE SAVE-REQ-PRT-NO-2       TO  REQ-SPOOL-PRT.
