                            NUM-QUOTES-PRINTED.

229100     MOVE "Y"  TO  PO-VENDOR-SW.

      *--------- "LAST VENDOR" INFO PRINTED EARLIER ON REQ.
      *    PERFORM 666-CHECK-LAST-VENDOR  THRU  666-CLV-X.
      *    IF VENDOR-SW = "Y"
      *        PERFORM 666-FIND-LAST-PO-VEND   THRU  666-GLPV-X
      *        PERFORM 667-PRINT-VENDOR-LINES  THRU  667-PVL-X
      *    ELSE
