      *        WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES
      *        MOVE ALL "-"             TO  DASH-LINE
      *        WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM DASH-LINE BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE
      *        MOVE SPACES              TO  PRINT-LINE1.


