229300**************************************************
229400*                                                *
229500*   THIS ROUTINE CHECKS FOR A PREFERRED VENDOR   *
229600*   FOR THE CORP CODE ON REQ (VEN-OF-RCD='S')    *
229700*   AND IF ONE IS FOUND PRINTS IT FIRST ON THE   *
229800*   REQ WITH A 'X' INDICATOR NEXT TO THE VENDOR  *
229900*   CODE                                         *
230000*                                                *
230100**************************************************
230200
230300     PERFORM 663-CHECK-FOR-PREFERRED-VENDOR THRU 663-CFPV-X.
230400*
      *------- START DVENDITM TO SEE IF MORE VENDORS EXIST.
           MOVE "N" TO READ-LAST-RCD-SW.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DVENDITM-REC-I.
           START DVENDITM-I KEY > CORPCDE OF DVENDITM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE "Y" TO READ-LAST-RCD-SW
               ELSE
230800             MOVE "DBFIND DVENDITM * 661-WVI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
230900             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
231000
231100**************************************************
231200*                                                *
231300*   IF A PREFERRED IS VENDOR IS FOUND PRINT IT   *
231400*   FIRST ON REQ.                                *
231500*                                                *
231600**************************************************
231700*
231800     IF VENDOR-SW  =  "Y"
231900         GO TO 661-WRITE-VENDOR-PRINT-LINE.

232000*
232100**************************************************
232200*                                                *
232300*   GET A VENDOR THAT SUPPLIES THE CODE FROM     *
232400*   DVENDITM                                     *
232500*                                                *
232600**************************************************
232700
232800     PERFORM 662-GET-DVENDITM THRU 662-GD-X.

233000**************************************************
