243600**************************************************
243700*                                                *
243800*   THIS ROUTINES LOADS FOR PRINT UP TO 3        *
243900*   VENDORS THAT SUPPLY THE PARTICULAR CODE AND  *
244000*   WRITES THEM ON THE REQ.                      *
244100*                                                *
244200**************************************************
244300
           MOVE SPACES                  TO PRINT-LINE1.
244400     MOVE LAST-4-PO-LIT           TO PRT-LAST-4-PO-LIT.
244500     MOVE 1                       TO LINE-ADV.
244600     PERFORM 65-PRINT-LINE.
244700
244800     PERFORM 664-LOAD-PO-LINE THRU 664-LPL-X.
245000     MOVE PRINT-PO-LINE           TO PRINT-LINE.
245100     WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE.
