248800**   QUOTES TO PRINT. NOW IF THE QUOTE HAS EXPIRED IT WILL   **
248900**   STILL PRINT.                                            **
249000***************************************************************
249100**               IF VEN-ITM-PRICE-DATE < SAVE-TODAYS-DATE  OR**
249200**               IF VEN-CREATE-DATE > SAVE-TODAYS-DATE OR    **
249300***************************************************************
249400
249500                 IF VEN-CREATE-DATE = SPACES OR
249600                    VEN-ITM-PRICE = ZEROS
249700                     MOVE "Y"  TO  MORE-VEND-ON-FILE-SW
249800                     GO TO 662-GET-DVENDITM
249900                 ELSE
250000                     MOVE "Y"  TO  VENDOR-SW
250100             ELSE
250200                 IF VEN-ITM-VENCODE = STR-LAST-VENDOR
250300                     GO TO 662-GET-DVENDITM
250400                 ELSE
250500                     MOVE "Y"  TO  MORE-VEND-ON-FILE-SW
250600                     GO TO 662-GET-DVENDITM.
