251300******************************************************
251400
251500 662-LOAD-DVENDITM-PRT.
251600*    MOVE SPACES  TO  PRT-CONTACT, PRT-PHONE, PRT-VEN-TERMS,
251700*                     PRT-TERMS-PC-DESC, PRT-TERMS-DD-DESC,
251800*                     DLV-TIME-LIT-OUT, PRT-CURRENCY-CODE,
251900*                     PRT-TELEX, TELEX-LIT-OUT,
