263300             MOVE VEN-PH-FIRST3   TO  PRT-PHONE-FIRST3
263400             MOVE VEN-PH-LAST4    TO  PRT-PHONE-LAST4
263500             MOVE "-"             TO  PRT-PHONE-DASH1,
263600                                      PRT-PHONE-DASH2
263700     ELSE
263800     IF VEN-ITM-NO  = 10
263900         PERFORM 663-LOAD-DVENDOR-TEN  THRU  663-LDT-X.
      *---------- NOT PRINTING THIS INFO ANY MORE ON REQ.
