                       AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS END-READ
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
281800                     GO TO 664-LPL-X
                       ELSE
282000                    MOVE "READ LAST DPOITEM* 664-LPL"
282000                        TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
282100                    GO TO 2-BLOWUP
                   ELSE
